// Syncthing ignore patterns — the Prosodia repo root is the synced exchange folder.
// Sync the source + the job handoff; skip VCS, virtualenvs, caches, weights, local state.
//
// IMPORTANT: do NOT add inbox/ outbox/ processing/ failed/ here — those ARE the
// author <-> renderer handoff and must sync. Only local-noise paths belong below.
//
// NOTE: Syncthing does not sync .stignore itself. Put the same file at the repo
// root on the render box too (or use the #include approach — see docs/HANDOFF.md).

// Version control — syncing .git between machines corrupts it
/.git

// Virtualenvs — each machine builds its own (authoring .venv vs render .venv-render)
/.venv
/.venv-render
/venv
/env

// Python caches & build artifacts (match at any depth)
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
*.egg-info
/build
/dist

// Local job staging — NOT the synced exchange (inbox/ etc. still sync)
/building
/jobs

// Prompt-refinement audit logs — authoring-side only
/experiments

// TTS model weights / caches — downloaded on the render box; huge; one-way clutter
/models
/weights
/hf_cache
.cache
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt

// Local tooling / editor / OS state
/.claude
.vscode
.idea
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
